<section id="faq" class="pt-10 border-t border-borderPurple">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-10">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primaryPurple px-2.5 py-1 bg-tintPurple rounded-[6px] border border-borderPurple">
        Frequently Asked Questions
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink mt-3 mb-2">
        Questions &amp; answers
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base text-muted">
        Important details on platform access, marketplace coverage, and operations.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4">

      <details class="group bg-surface rounded-[8px] border border-borderPurple transition-colors" open>
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 text-left font-semibold text-ink cursor-pointer min-h-[44px]">
          <span class="text-base sm:text-lg">What is AISLEY?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 flex-shrink-0 ml-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-muted leading-relaxed border-t border-borderPurple/50 pt-3">
          AISLEY is a Philippine multi-vendor marketplace connecting independent shops directly with buyers. It supports Cash on Delivery checkout and tracks orders across verified merchant preparation and delivery phases.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="group bg-surface rounded-[8px] border border-borderPurple transition-colors">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 text-left font-semibold text-ink cursor-pointer min-h-[44px]">
          <span class="text-base sm:text-lg">Is AISLEY available everywhere?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 flex-shrink-0 ml-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-muted leading-relaxed border-t border-borderPurple/50 pt-3">
          AISLEY is currently in early access. Product availability and specific delivery options depend strictly on participating shops and their active operational coverage. Buyers should review individual item availability and checkout options for their address.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="group bg-surface rounded-[8px] border border-borderPurple transition-colors">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 text-left font-semibold text-ink cursor-pointer min-h-[44px]">
          <span class="text-base sm:text-lg">How does Admin approval work for sellers and logistics hubs?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 flex-shrink-0 ml-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-muted leading-relaxed border-t border-borderPurple/50 pt-3">
          Both Seller and Logistics hub portal accounts require manual verification and approval by AISLEY Platform Administrators before merchant or hub tools can be accessed. Individual couriers are subsequently approved and onboarded directly by their associated Logistics organization.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="group bg-surface rounded-[8px] border border-borderPurple transition-colors">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 text-left font-semibold text-ink cursor-pointer min-h-[44px]">
          <span class="text-base sm:text-lg">Where can I get mobile apps?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 flex-shrink-0 ml-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-muted leading-relaxed border-t border-borderPurple/50 pt-3">
          Mobile application packages for both Buyers and affiliated Riders are released directly on GitHub via official public repositories (ApueXI/aisley-app-customer and ApueXI/aisley-app-rider). Visitors should inspect the release notes and package assets directly before installing.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="group bg-surface rounded-[8px] border border-borderPurple transition-colors">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 text-left font-semibold text-ink cursor-pointer min-h-[44px]">
          <span class="text-base sm:text-lg">Does tracking show a live courier location?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 flex-shrink-0 ml-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-muted leading-relaxed border-t border-borderPurple/50 pt-3">
          No. Order tracking shows recorded shipment milestones (such as parcel packed, waybill printed, hub handoff, and out for delivery). Continuous real-time GPS courier coordinates are not promised or provided.
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center mt-10">
      <a href="https://aisley.app"
         class="inline-flex items-center justify-center min-h-[44px] px-6 py-2.5 bg-primaryPurple hover:bg-primaryHover text-surface text-sm font-semibold rounded-[8px] transition-colors shadow-sm"
         target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Start shopping
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
